## Geo (LGPL-3.0-or-later)

YAAT dynamically links the `Geo` library for NOAA World Magnetic Model (WMM)
computations. The library is consumed as an unmodified NuGet package reference,
and end users may replace `Geo.dll` in the installed directory with a compatible
build to satisfy LGPL §4(d)(1).

  Upstream: https://github.com/sibartlett/Geo
  Package:  https://www.nuget.org/packages/Geo/
  License:  GNU Lesser General Public License v3.0 or later (LGPL-3.0-or-later)
  Full text: https://www.gnu.org/licenses/lgpl-3.0.txt

Copyright (c) Simon Bartlett and contributors.

## piper-phonemize and espeak-ng (GPL-3.0-or-later)

YAAT phonemizes pilot-voice text with the `piper_phonemize_core` native
library, which statically links espeak-ng. It is consumed as an unmodified
NuGet package reference. The espeak-ng data it reads ships inside the Piper
voice pack that YAAT downloads on request.

  Upstream: https://github.com/csukuangfj/piper-phonemize
            https://github.com/espeak-ng/espeak-ng
  Package:  https://www.nuget.org/packages/com.github.csukuangfj.piper.phonemize/
  License:  GNU General Public License v3.0 or later (GPL-3.0-or-later)
  Full text: https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.txt

Copyright (c) the piper-phonemize and espeak-ng contributors.

